152GD    152TB EC+B+ DECAY:XUNDL-17    2026OSAA                           202606
152GD dE EAV,LOGFT$From BetaShape v2.4 (Jun-2024) 2023Mo21.                     
152GD dL E$Least-squares fitting is done by GLSC (version 12-Jun-2026)          
152GD c  Compiled by L. J. Sun and J. Chen (FRIB, MSU), June 30, 2026.          
152GD c  Phys. Rev. C xxx, xxxxxx (2026).                                       
152GD c  2026OsAA: {+152}Dy and daughter {+152}Tb were produced via spallation  
152GD2c  reactions induced by a 1.4-GeV proton beam on a tantalum target at     
152GD3c  CERN-ISOLDE. The ions were accelerated to 30 keV and A=152 nuclei were 
152GD4c  separated by deflection in a magnetic dipole and implanted into a pair 
152GD5c  of Al foils for |g-|g spectroscopy and a metallised Mylar foil for     
152GD6c  electron-|g spectroscopy. The samples were delivered to ILL Grenoble   
152GD7c  and the measurements started 40 hours after the end of collection.     
152GD8c  |g-|g coincidence spectroscopy was performed for 7 days using the      
152GD9c  Fission Product Prompt |g-ray Spectrometer (FIPPS) consisting of 16    
152GDAc  Compton-shielded HPGe clover detectors. Electron-|g coincidence        
152GDBc  spectroscopy was performed for 37.5 hours using the LOHENGRIN/PN1      
152GDCc  conversion-electron spectroscopy setup consisting of a HPGe clover     
152GDDc  paired with a 4-mm-thick lithium-drifted silicon detector. Measured    
152GDEc  E|g, I|g, x rays, |g|g-coin, |g|g(|q). Deduced levels, J, |p, |g-ray   
152GDFc  multipolarities, mixing ratios, level densities, |b-feeding            
152GDGc  intensities, and log {Ift}.                                            
152GD cE TI$From I(|g+ce) intensity balance at each level. The decay scheme is  
152GD2cE considered fairly complete.                                            
152GD cG E,RI$From 2026OsAA.                                                    
152GD cG M,MR$From 2026OsAA with angular correlation analysis. Table IV of      
152GD2cG 2026OsAA lists all mixing ratios, which are included in the comments.  
152GD3cG Table I of 2026OsAA lists only mixing ratios not consistent with zero, 
152GD4cG which are included in the |d data field records.                       
152GD cL E$From a least-squares fit to |g-ray energies.                         
152GD cL J$From 2026OsAA based on angular correlation analysis.                 
